  "full_feedback": [
    "No blocking defect found within the frozen static late managed-text refusal scope. The minimal preflight read closes the observed prior partial-removal sequence without caching a stale ownership decision for the removal loop.",
    "The raw baseline is discriminating: invalid UTF-8, oversized text and injected late read error expose removed earlier files; valid edited/unowned data control already passes. The fourth failure shows why preserving deletion-time reread matters. Fixed and independent both pass the same55 methods.",
    "The historical SETUP-TEXT report explicitly excludes late managed-text no-mutation and documents partial uninstall. The full20261023 uninstall review covers malformed manifest shape and explicitly excludes transaction guarantees. Neither historical result is promoted into acceptance of this new property.",
    "Prior-results search is357scanned/partial=true/25missing-record errors; only the old text report gives a directly relevant boundary. Empty knowledge query is not evidence of global absence. Existing old failed/paused gates, FD57 and backend/process/full-suite budgets are untouched; no old runner was retried.",
    "The two CLI refusal assertions are real offline child setup.py invocations. The injected read-error case is an API simulation, and no extra cross-process permission-error probe was run. This distinction should remain in reporting.",
    "The module-alias reuse invokes only SetupTextTests.snapshot(self); no imported TestCase class is discoverable as a new-module class. The source-defined method counts and raw unique IDs agree at55 without duplicated old text-reader methods.",
    "Workflow delta adds the new module to four Ubuntu/Windows matrix instances and one macOS job; macOS TMPDIR stays attached to each relevant step. Source configuration is not native CI execution evidence. Root must inspect actual new-module execution and omissions before native-platform acceptance.",
    "Review writes are restricted to this run namespace. No source, guide, TASK, shared helper, network/backend/GPU/FD or full-suite mutation/probe was made. The sole behavioral invocation is the authorized independent55.",
    "This manual scoped independent review is not an authenticated ReviewSession/runtime dispatch receipt, deployed-host proof or universal project certificate. It does not establish model task quality, total costs, performance or SYSTEM-99 completion. Root owns integration, publication, remote readback and native CI acceptance."
  ],
